BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Color and Form: Kathleen Fleming Gallery Opening
DTSTART:20261106T160000
DTEND:20261106T180000
DTSTAMP:20261106T180711Z
UID:3df904c090a47983ccc67f3b173141@vermont-events
DESCRIPTION:Join us Friday\, November 6\, from 4 to 6 PM to celebrate Colo
 r and Form\, new work by Vermont artist Kathleen Fleming! Kathleen builds 
 her paintings from layers of paint\, collage and pastel. The results are c
 olor-rich abstractions inspired by the Vermont landscape. Her work was fea
 tured in this year's show at The Kent Museum in Calais. Come meet the arti
 st\, enjoy free appetizers and drinks\, and see the work up close. Everyth
 ing in the show is for sale. Free and open to all!\n\nSources: Vermont Pub
 lic
LOCATION:Front Seat Coffee\, 101 South Main Street
URL:https://www.vermontpublic.org/vermont-events-calendar/event/color-and-
 form-kathleen-fleming-gallery-opening-28-10-2026-16-44-06
END:VEVENT
