BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:FOR THE LOVE OF DOLLY: A Green Mountain Tribute To Dolly Parton
DTSTART:20261106T193000
DTEND:20261106T213000
DTSTAMP:20261106T180711Z
UID:68b2df2bac6d5ea13bc22c14d0b949@vermont-events
DESCRIPTION:The "Here In The Valley" artist collective presents a tribute 
 concert to the beloved Dolly Parton. Dolly Parton was born in a one-room c
 abin in Tennessee\, the 4th of 12 children. She sang in her church as a sm
 all child\, on the local radio at 10\, and made her Grand Ole Opry debut a
 t 13. She was a glorious singer and\, over the span of her career\, releas
 ed more than 50 albums. She starred in movies\, wrote books\, ruled an emp
 ire\, and gave generously to lift the world around her. And all of that wa
 s built on the brilliance of her songwriting. This is a celebration of her
  life and her songs. ​Featuring Jes Raymond\, Lisa Piccirillo ​and Mir
 anda Scott\, with Allison Fay\, Jen Freise\, Madonna Gordon and more! Back
 ed by the "Here In The Valley" House Band\n\nSources: Vermont Public
LOCATION:Briggs Opera House\, 5 South Main Street
URL:https://www.vermontpublic.org/vermont-events-calendar/event/for-the-lo
 ve-of-dolly-a-green-mountain-tribute-to-dolly-parton-28-10-2026-09-07-34
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Get the Led Out
DTSTART:20261106T193000
DTEND:20261106T213000
DTSTAMP:20261106T180711Z
UID:6a3fc2228fc76e910194ab6cab462a@vermont-events
DESCRIPTION:From the bombastic and epic\, to the folky and mystical\, Get 
 the Led Out (GTLO) has captured the essence of the recorded music of Led Z
 eppelin and brought it to the concert stage. The Philadelphia-based group 
 consists of six veteran musicians intent on delivering Led Zeppelin live\,
  like you’ve never heard before. Utilizing the multi-instrumentalists at
  their disposal\, GTLO recreates the songs in all their depth and glory wi
 th the studio overdubs that Zeppelin themselves never performed. When you 
 hear three guitars on the album…GTLO delivers three guitarists on stage.
  No wigs or fake English accents\, GTLO brings what the audience wants…a
  high energy Zeppelin concert with an honest\, heart-thumping intensity. 3
 0 Center St Rutland \, Vermont 05701 802-775-0903 boxoffice@paramountvt.or
