 ing-reception/
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Hands-Only CPR
DTSTART:20261106T120000
DTEND:20261106T130000
DTSTAMP:20261106T180711Z
UID:6ae9b73905c2c26da285c895b6da61@vermont-events
DESCRIPTION:Hands-Only CPR: When the time comes to save someone’s life\,
  will you BE READY? 70 percent of out-of-hospital cardiac arrests happen i
 n the home. Statistically speaking\, if you are called on to give CPR in a
 n emergency\, you will most likely be trying to save the life of someone y
 ou love: a spouse\, a parent\, a child or a friend. Neighborhood Connectio
 ns is pleased to bring to the community an opportunity to learn about and 
 practice Hands-Only CPR. This method is effective and can significantly in
 crease the chances of survival for the victim\, especially in the first fe
 w minutes of cardiac arrest. It is simple to learn and can be performed by
  anyone\, even without formal CPR training. Join us on Friday\, November 6
 th for a session being held in our New Activity Center across from our off
 ices at 5700 Rte 100\, in Londonderry\, Vermont at 12 PM. The one-hour ses
 sion is FREE and will be followed with light refreshments. Neighborhood Co
 nnections\n\nSources: Vermont Public
LOCATION:Vermont Public is independent\, community-supported media\, servi
 ng Vermont with trusted\, relevant and essential information. We share sto
 ries that bring people together\, from every corner of our region.\, © 20
 26 Vermont Public | 365 Troy Ave. Colchester\, VT 05446
URL:https://www.vermontpublic.org/vermont-events-calendar/event/hands-only
 -cpr-13-10-2026-12-12-11
END:VEVENT
