BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:KCP Presents: Dorrance Dance
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261106
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261107
DTSTAMP:20261106T180711Z
UID:f0332a08250ff5e2b181c365b48a30@vermont-events
DESCRIPTION:Featuring Elizabeth Burke and Luke Hickey\, Dorrance Dance is 
 led by MacArthur Genius Fellow Michelle Dorrance\, dubbed\, “one of the 
 most imaginative choreographers working today\,” by the New York Times. 
 Combining breathtaking athleticism\, infectious rhythm\, live music\, and 
 inventive choreography\, Dorrance Dance tap dancers reinvent rhythm\, for 
 innovative\, sophisticated\, and irresistibly entertaining performances. E
 very dancer becomes both musician and storyteller\, turning the stage into
  a vibrant percussion instrument. Whether you’re discovering tap dance f
 or the first time or you’re a longtime fan seeing it anew\, Dorrance Dan
 ce reveals extraordinary beauty\, joy\, and imagination in one of America
 ’s original art forms. It explores what is most thrilling\, brilliant\, 
 and beautiful about tap dancing: that it is both the movement and the musi
 c. The KCP Presents Performing Arts Series showcases world-class internati
 onal touring acts throughout Vermont’s Northeast Kingdom. Renowned for b
 ringing big city entertainment to Vermont’s small towns\, KCP Presents h
 as scheduled ten shows this season\, including a joyful South African yout
 h choir\, enchanting Scandinavian folk music\, thrilling Japanese drummers
 \, death-defying Chinese acrobats\, and live dance\, comedy\, and music ac
 ts from all over the United States. Lyndon Institute Auditorium\n\nSources
 : Vermont.com\, Vermont Public
LOCATION:Vermont Public is independent\, community-supported media\, servi
 ng Vermont with trusted\, relevant and essential information. We share sto
 ries that bring people together\, from every corner of our region.\, © 20
 26 Vermont Public | 365 Troy Ave. Colchester\, VT 05446
URL:https://www.vermontpublic.org/vermont-events-calendar/event/kcp-presen
 ts-dorrance-dance-20-10-2026-12-11-02
END:VEVENT
