BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Ten Minute Plays at Stone Valley Arts in November
DTSTART:20261106T173000
DTEND:20261106T190000
DTSTAMP:20261106T180711Z
UID:7601455590cb0b08580ba2ccba1e3d@vermont-events
DESCRIPTION:Theater in the Woods' annual fundraiser of dinner theater is N
 ovember 6 & 7\, and November 13\, 14 and 15 at Stone Valley Arts in Poultn
 ey. The Sunday November 15 matinee is at 2 pm with refreshments served aft
 erwards. Come see what this year's crop of plays are about! Authors are: H
 erb Childress\, Live Lane\, Jon Mathewson\, Charles Stevens\, Glenn Tarbel
 l\, Lauryn Axelrod\, Martin Van Buren III and Mike Worden. Directed by Meg
  Bouchard\, Mikki Lane\, Lauryn Axelrod\, Glenn Tarbell and Lina Cloffe\, 
 and Evan Breault. Tickets are $30 for the evenings which includes the dinn
 er\; the matinee is $25. The Stone Valley Arts space is warm\, welcoming\,
  and intimate\, and tends to sell out. Please go to this link to get your 
 tickets: https://www.theaterinthewoodsvt.org/ten-minute-plays/ Major spons
 ors are Noble's Hardware\, O'Brien Reynolds Shortle & Sabotka PC\, MacScra
 p ("a refuge for the starving artist!") and the Mountain Times. Also spons
 ored by The Sparkle Barn\, Laughing Child Farm\, Wisewell Goods\, Miskaton
 ic Performing Arts\, and Mark and Margaret McChesney. 30\n\nSources: Vermo
 nt Public
LOCATION:Stone Valley Arts\, 145 East Main Street
URL:https://www.vermontpublic.org/vermont-events-calendar/event/ten-minute
 -plays-at-stone-valley-arts-in-november-22-10-2026-23-18-12
END:VEVENT
